{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37720","headline":"光化戊午年举公见示省试春草碧色诗偶赋是题 · 郑谷","name":"光化戊午年举公见示省试春草碧色诗偶赋是题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苌弘血染新，含露满江滨。\n想得寻花径，应迷拾翠人。\n窗纱迎拥砌，簪玉妬成茵。\n天借新晴色，云饶落日春。\n岚光垂处合，眉黛看时嚬。\n愿与仙桃比，无令惹路尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}